MENT ADVICE␀␀PAY TO THE ORDER OF:␀␀␀␀DATE:␀␀␀Signed:␀CONGRATULATIONS ON FINISHING YOUR CONTRACT!␀␀␀␀␀Click to continue␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ANIMATRONICS␀␀␀␀CREDITS␀MODIFIERS␀␀␀␀␀␀␀A/D - Panels  |  ESC - Back␀␀␀␀␀The Mafia Boss. Watches from the curtains and strikes from the left hall.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀The enforcer. Extremely fast and aggressive on the right hall.␀␀Technical specialist. Uses the vents to bypass your defenses.␀␀␀Infinite Energy␀Fast Nights (2x)␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ENABLED␀DISABLED␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Created by:␀␀␀␀␀Special thanks:␀WARNING␀This game contains flashing lights, loud noises␀and many jumpscares.␀␀␀␀DO NOT PLAY if you have epilepsy or are sensitive␀␀␀␀␀␀␀to sudden frights.␀␀␀␀␀␀Press ENTER to advance␀␀Press ENTER to start the night␀␀Mafia of Tabacudos␀␀␀␀␀␀# security␀␀␀␀␀␀Message #security␀␀␀␀␀␀␀# general␀␀␀␀␀␀␀# announcements␀# cameras␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Power Left: %d%%␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Usage:␀␀Quality␀High␀␀␀␀Low␀␀␀␀␀READY␀␀␀W/S - Adjust AI | ENTER - Start␀Loading...␀␀␀␀␀␀TIP: Use the light to check the hallways.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀TIP: Eser can be seen on cameras, but he's fast.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀TIP: If Alice is in the vents, use the mask.␀␀␀␀TIP: Save power. The night is long.␀␀␀␀␀TIP: Doors only drain power when closed.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀TIP: Cedro attacks from the left side.␀␀TIP: Sonk hates being watched.␀␀TIP: Eser attacks from the right side.␀␀TIP: Listen carefully to the sounds.␀␀␀␀TIP: Survive until 6 AM.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀FUN FACT: The pizzeria was shut down 3 times by health inspection.␀␀␀␀␀␀FUN FACT: They say the dev's animatronic never sleeps.␀␀ACHIEVEMENTS - FIVE NIGHTS WITH FRIENDS␀Press ESC or SPACE to go back␀␀␀The local hero.␀THE TABACUDOS GAZETTE␀␀␀PIZZERIA SHUT DOWN!␀␀␀␀␀CORRUPTION SCHEME EXPOSED␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Former security guard Renan Lucas turned in␀␀␀␀␀to authorities a series of confidential logs␀␀␀␀from Discord proving the Pizzeria was␀␀␀a center of clandestine Mafia operations.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀The 'Big Boss' Cedro and his accomplices fled␀␀␀before the police arrived...␀␀␀␀Renan Lucas received the title of local hero.␀␀␀APPLY CODE␀␀␀␀␀␀Don't push it␀␀␀Don't call me a dictator␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀MAFIA OF TABACUDOS BRAZIL␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Hey Renan! How's it going?␀␀␀␀␀␀Boy, the Mafia of Tabacudos is expanding. We opened the Pizza place and need someone we can trust.␀␀␀␀␀␀The shift is midnight to six. Pay is good, but the place is a bit... 'active' at night.␀Oh, if it pays well, I'm in! What could go wrong at a pizzeria?␀Hahaha that's the spirit! I gave you the Security role here in the server. Join the #cameras channel.␀␀␀Listen carefully: MÃ¡fia and I... we like to test security. You know, Mafia training.␀␀␀If we vanish from the stage on the cameras, it's because we're coming to visit.␀Wait, 'visit'? In those huge suits? This smells like a prank.␀␀␀Keep an eye on the lights and doors. If I come from the left or Eser from the right, CLOSE EVERYTHING.␀␀But watch the power, the pizzeria's generator is powered by snacks and it's almost out.␀Oh, and Alice... she doesn't like the stage much. She likes tight spaces, like the vents.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Cedro... why do your voices sound so metallic? And why is this place so dark?␀␀␀Side effect of 'business', Renanzin. Stay in the room, save light, and survive until 6. If you win, there's a bonus!␀␀␀␀Minimum wage? Now it's a serious job. I'm in.␀␀␀Nice, you survived the first night.␀␀␀␀␀Not gonna lie, I almost had five heart attacks.␀Tonight we push harder. Eser is already warming up his circuits.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀If he moves that fast, I'll run out of power in half an hour.␀␀␀Use cameras calmly. Door only when you are sure.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀And pay attention to footsteps. They reveal who is close.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Night 3. Sonk is now in the game.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Another one? This place is becoming an arena.␀␀␀He starts at Pirate Cove and sprints to the left door.␀␀So I need to check his camera often.␀␀␀␀Exactly. Ignore him for too long and he runs with no warning.␀␀␀Great. I'll survive on pure reflex.␀␀␀␀␀You're going too far, security guard.␀␀␀And you keep trying to take me down every night.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀On Night 4, Alice will pressure the vents harder.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀If I hear vent noise, I know she's close.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Right. And remember: no power, no defense.␀␀␀␀␀␀Understood. Power management and cold blood.␀␀␀␀We reached Night 5. The main one.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀If I pass tonight, does my contract end?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀It ends... in theory.␀␀␀That's way too suspicious for my taste.␀Just hold until 6AM and take your paycheck.␀␀␀␀␀Deal. Tonight no one takes me out of that office.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Renan... are you still here?␀␀␀␀The salary hit the account, Cedro. But I saw things I wasn't supposed to see on those cameras.␀␀You're curious, right? The Mafia doesn't like curious people. But if you want to know what happens on Night 6...␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Be warned: Eser and Alice aren't playing anymore. They are furious.␀␀␀␀␀I already understand your game. I accept the challenge. Let's finish this.␀␀␀␀␀␀Then survive. If you do, maybe you'll discover the truth about the Mafia Pizzeria.␀␀␀␀␀␀So you want to play Custom Night?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀I want to end this on the hardest mode.␀Type the right code and you'll see this place's hell mode.␀␀␀␀␀␀Cedro, Eser, Alice and Sonk with no mercy. No safe route.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Perfect. I won't show mercy either.␀␀␀␀␀Then get in and prove you can hold until 6AM.␀␀␀Hey bro! You survived! Congrats on the first night!␀␀␀␀␀But don't relax... Night 2 is more intense.␀␀␀␀␀Me and Eser are gonna move faster now.␀␀Faster?? It was already hard enough!␀␀␀␀Chill, you already know the deal. Cameras, doors, lights.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Just don't waste power. Good luck!␀␀␀␀␀␀Two nights! You're getting good at this!␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Night 3 is where it gets really serious.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀We're going to be much more aggressive now...␀␀␀Are you guys doing this on purpose?␀␀␀␀␀Hehehe... maybe. Stay sharp on both sides!␀␀␀␀␀␀save.dat␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀config.dat␀␀␀␀␀␀portas.ogg␀␀␀␀␀␀trocar_camera.ogg␀␀␀␀␀␀␀footstep␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀passos.ogg␀␀␀␀␀␀footsteps_1␀␀␀␀␀footsteps_2␀␀␀␀␀footsteps_3␀␀␀␀␀footsteps_4␀␀␀␀␀breathing␀␀␀␀␀␀␀usando_a_mascara.ogg␀␀␀␀colocar_mascara.ogg␀␀␀␀␀mask_off␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀retirar_mascara.ogg␀␀␀␀␀select␀␀notification␀␀␀␀camera␀␀clock␀␀␀noite_concluida.ogg␀␀␀␀␀noite_concluida␀ventilacao.ogg␀␀window_scare␀␀␀␀animatronic_na_porta.ogg␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀animatronic_door␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀power_out␀␀␀␀␀␀␀audio/␀␀menu_ambient␀␀␀␀footsteps_␀␀␀␀␀␀std::vector<_Tp, _Alloc>::reference std::vector<_Tp, _Alloc>::back() [with _Tp = fnwf::TouchButton; _Alloc = std::allocator<fnwf::TouchButton>; reference = fnwf::TouchButton&]␀std::vector<_Tp, _Alloc>::reference std::vector<_Tp, _Alloc>::back() [with _Tp = fnwf::ProjectionSlice; _Alloc = std::allocator<fnwf::ProjectionSlice>; reference = fnwf::ProjectionSlice&]␀␀␀␀␀NIGHT SHIFT␀␀␀␀␀DOOR CTRL␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ERROR: Failed to create office render targets
